the playstation app has become an  absolute game changer for ps5 users  especially if you like to share your  favorite screenshots and video clips  online or save them straight to your  phone in the past this was a more  cumbersome process as you had to connect  a usb thumb drive or external hard drive  and then transfer over to a computer  while that method does still work thanks  to the playstation app you can now  download recent screenshots or videos  directly to your ios or android device  first you'll need to set up a few things  on your ps5 console start by going to  your settings and then captures and  broadcasts then go to the screenshot  format and make sure it's set to png  rather than jpeg this will ensure your  screenshots are the highest possible  quality if you're playing on an hdr  display you'll also have the option of  whether or not you want the screenshots  to capture hdr however enabling the hdr  capture locks you out of selecting the  png format personally i recommend  turning the hdr capture off and going  with png next you'll want to go back to  the previous menu and scroll all the way  to the bottom make sure auto upload is  enabled this will ensure your  screenshots and video clips from your  ps5 will be uploaded and made available  on the ps app for 14 days after you  create them note the uploads will only  begin once you have this setting enabled  so any screenshots you've already taken  will not show up in the app now we're  ready to grab our mobile device and fire  up the ps app you'll need to tap the  fourth icon along the bottom row here  which is the game library then tap  captures and you'll see a list of all  the photos and videos you've captured on  your ps5 for the past 14 days scroll  down tap on a photo and then tap the  arrow in the bottom right corner to  download straight to your device if  you'd like to download more than one  screenshot at a time tap the white  circle and check mark icon in the bottom  right of the captures page here at the  time of this video recording 4 is the  maximum number you can select at a time  hopefully that gets bumped up in the  future and then finally head to the  photos app on your phone where you'll  find all your new screenshots and videos  you'll even find that a new folder has  been auto-generated for you called ps  app which will house all your downloads  directly from the playstation app as  always thank you all so much for  watching i'll talk to you again soon
 

